  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UWsTm2svK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" alt=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" width=\"441\" height=\"129\"></a></strong></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">全新Discord服务器！提供专属支持与更新提醒</span></h1><h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>机械动力：掠夺者崛起（建筑）</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">通过引入</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>机械化掠夺者堡垒</strong></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">与</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>工程化前哨站</strong></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">，将</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>机械动力模组</strong></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">的创造力与掠夺者的致命智慧完美融合，为你的 Minecraft 世界增添全新维度。这些建筑绝非普通掠夺者前哨——这些基地配备了复杂的机械装置、自动化防御系统和精妙陷阱，即使是最经验丰富的冒险者也将面临严峻挑战。&nbsp;</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">别忘了查看我个人主页上的其他模组！</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">本模组现由 Mei_Xiao_gong（首席开发者）所有</span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/977/pill.png\" alt=\"pill\" width=\"230\" height=\"230\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/978/638598725500886388.webp\" alt=\"create\" width=\"231\" height=\"231\"></span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">下载机械动力模组：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a></span></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">想要更艰难的战斗？下载：</span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillagers-gun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">掠夺者之枪</a></span></span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/956/28/pillagers-spawned-on-my-base-v0-qg3r7317xebb1.webp\" alt=\"pillager\" width=\"580\" height=\"461\"></span></span></p><h1>&nbsp;</h1><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/949/805/create-mod-minecraft.jpg\" alt=\"create mod\" width=\"1200\" height=\"640\"></span></p><h1><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">做好准备</span>迎接策略性突袭，你的战斗技巧与机械理解力都将面临考验！</span></h1><h1><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong\">丰厚战利品</strong>：</span>成功突袭这些强化基地，获取稀有战利品，包括机械动力模组材料、蓝图和组件，可用于强化你自己的建筑。<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/995/steam_engine.webp\" alt=\"steam\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\"></span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1057/896/minecraft__1.png\" alt=\"catahrdral\" width=\"2158\" height=\"1091\"></span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">运作方式：</span></h1><ol>\n<li>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>探索世界</strong>：</span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">在世界中随机生成这些升级版掠夺者建筑，从简单的机械化前哨到宏伟复杂的堡垒应有尽有。</span></h1>\n</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n</ol><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">安装指南：</span></h1><ol>\n<li>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>安装机械动力模组</strong>：</span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">本模组需要</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>机械动力模组</strong></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">作为前置，请确保已正确安装并运行。</span></h1>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>下载掠夺者崛起（建筑）</strong>：</span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">将模组文件放入<code>.minecraft/mods</code>文件夹</span></h1>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>启动游戏</strong>：</span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">开始游戏，尽情探索这些复杂的新掠夺者堡垒和前哨站！</span></h1>\n</li>\n</ol><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/324/kagud6s.png\" alt=\"forge\" width=\"164\" height=\"164\"></span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">仅支持Forge：</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">1.19.2</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">1.20.1</span></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/904/291/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"intelij\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"></span></p><ol>\n<li>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">本模组使用开发工具：IntelliJ</span></h1>\n</li>\n</ol><h1>产品声明：非官方Minecraft产品，未经Mojang或Microsoft认可或关联</h1><p>&nbsp;</p>",
